      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the storage room, the persistent female guest corners Louis and says she missed him terribly. Louis awkwardly confesses that she was the very first girl he ever slept with and that they cannot be together, only for Chef Barinov to burst in reciting poetry.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Луи, извини, что я отвлекаю тебя от работы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Просто я очень соскучился.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
